  SCENE 4. LOCATOR: where exactly it leaks, and a patch
  truncate one availability channel at a time; the program is still not read
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  scene 2: our reference code, v1  (7 availability channels, seed time 2018-04-01)
    ▶ flat.review_score: value known after t     → review_score_mean, review_score_min  (732 cells)
    ▶ flat.late: value known after t             → late_mean  (605 cells)
    ▶ flat.delay_days: value known after t       → delay_days_mean  (677 cells)
    patch: truncate the input on the 3 channel(s) found, nothing else  →  CLEAN  localisation 0.7 s, re-check 0.2 s

  scene 1: featuretools defaults  (7 availability channels, seed time 2018-04-01)
    ▶ items: rows after t                        → COUNT(items), MAX(items.freight_value), MAX(items.price), MEAN(items.freight_value), MEAN(items.price) …  (19334 cells)
    patch: truncate the input on the 1 channel(s) found, nothing else  →  CLEAN  localisation 30.2 s, re-check 5.6 s

